# New DLL Added to AppInit_DLLs Registry Key | T1546.010 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/registry/registry_event/registry_event_new_dll_added_to_appinit_dlls_registry_key.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" (EventCode IN (12, 13, 14)) (TargetObject IN ("*\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows NT\\CurrentVersion\\Windows\\AppInit_Dlls", "*\\SOFTWARE\\Wow6432Node\\Microsoft\\Windows NT\\CurrentVersion\\Windows\\AppInit_Dlls") OR NewName IN ("*\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows NT\\CurrentVersion\\Windows\\AppInit_Dlls", "*\\SOFTWARE\\Wow6432Node\\Microsoft\\Windows NT\\CurrentVersion\\Windows\\AppInit_Dlls")) NOT Details="(Empty)"
